generation_strategy:
  approach: output-first — build mirrored output, then remove mirrored pixels to derive input
  steps:
    1. Choose grid size H×W ∈ [18,28], bg color (not 2)
    2. Decide marker count (3-7) and type mix (row, col, isolated)
    3. For each row/col marker — build the full mirrored output sprite pair first
       a. Pick payload color (non-bg, non-2, unique per group)
       b. Generate random connected payload sprite (3-11 px)
       c. Place red line adjacent to one edge; mirror payload across line
